# Bunker 2, speedrun route. Bond starts unarmed in a locked cell: the magnet watch may pull the floor key in, else the
# guard's visit (ai_4) comes only while Bond stands within 25 of pad 99 - the speedrun movement never settled there in
# round 5/6 tests, so the cell steps are `slow` (the normal bot's movement). From the cell on: speedrun.
name bunker2
slow equip watchmagnetattract
slow face -3288 120 4993
slow press z 180
slow goto pad 99 20
obj=1 collect obj 2
key 0x2
use obj 3 120
auto
goto pad 51 40
exit
